# Pages compose components

`app/**/page.tsx` files must only import components and render them. No hooks, no mock data, no SVG, no fetch.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
'use client';
import { useState } from 'react';
import { floors } from '@/lib/mockData';
export default function Page() {
  const [id, setId] = useState(floors[0].id);
  return <div>{id}</div>;
}

// ✅ GOOD
import { SeatingDashboard } from '@/components/SeatingDashboard';
export default function Page() {
  return <SeatingDashboard />;
}
```

Put state and layout in `components/`. Keep pages as Server Components unless a file convention requires otherwise.
